# Delney, Streetwise Lookout: "Creatures you control with power 2 or less can't be blocked by creatures with power 3 or
# greater" (CR 509.1b). Power exactly 2 may block: Bot2's Sanguine Evangelist (2/1) blocks the attacking Delney (2/2).
# Once blocks are declared the restriction has done its work (the rulings: "increasing the power of the creature blocking
# it to 3 or greater won't cause it to become unblocked"): Bot2 casts Full Bore on the Evangelist (+3/+2, 5/3), the block
# stands, Delney dies to 5 damage and the Evangelist survives 2.

